:: Burnout {"position":"150,25","size":"100,100"}
# Burnout
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1456406644174-8ddd4cd52a06?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="A lonely light in a dark room">

You have pushed yourself too hard for too long.

You stop sleeping. You stop eating properly. You stop showing up.

By the time anyone notices, it is too late to catch up. You do not finish the year.

Rest is not weakness. It is the foundation everything else is built on.

[[Play Again->Start]]


:: December {"position":"1150,150","size":"100,100"}
(display: "StatDisplay")
# December — Midterms
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1434030216411-0b793f4b4173?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="A pen on a test paper">

The exam room is silent. Paper on desk. No phones. No laptops. No Cognito.

"You have ninety minutes. Begin."

[[Do your honest best->December Honest]]
[[Try to cheat->Expelled]]


