:: January {"position":"150,275","size":"100,100"}
(display: "StatDisplay")
# January — The Scan
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1550751827-4bd374c3f58b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Computer code and security">

The principal speaks over the PA:

"As of this month, the school will be using detection software to scan all assignments submitted this year for AI-generated content."

The room goes very quiet.

(if: $usedAI)[
Your stomach drops. You have used Cognito. This could be bad.

[[Hope they do not find it->Expelled]]
[[Come clean to the principal now->January Confess]]
](else:)[
You have nothing to worry about. Every word you submitted was your own.

[[Continue->Late January]]
]



