:: Late September {"position":"650,25","size":"100,100"}
(display: "StatDisplay")
# Late September — The Rumour
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Students talking in a hallway">

Between classes, you catch pieces of a conversation.

"Cognito finished my whole history essay in like four minutes."
"No way. Did you get caught?"
"Nah. It even writes in your style."

You keep walking. But the name sticks in your head. Cognito.

