# March — The Wait
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1512428559083-a401a30c9550?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Smartphone on a table">

Spring is here. Exams are done. All that is left is one email.

University admissions results.

You sit with your phone in your hand.

[[Open the email->Results]]


