You team up with your crew — until someone pulls up Cognito at the second meeting.

"Dude, this thing writes better than us. Come on."

The whole group is on board. Except maybe you.

[[Join them — use Cognito->November Friends AI]]
[[Leave the group and work alone->November Solo]]


