<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1456513080510-7bf3a84b82f8?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="A desk lamp lighting up books at night">

You lose track of time with friends. By the time you get home it is past midnight.

Your stomach drops. Assignment due tomorrow morning.

What do you do?

[[Pull an all-nighter and do it yourself->October Allnighter]]
[[Use Cognito and get to sleep early->October AI]]


