:: Results {"position":"525,400","size":"100,100"}
(display: "StatDisplay")
# The Email

Your phone buzzes.

---

(if: $currentGPA >= 4.0)[
Congratulations. You have been accepted to your first choice university.

"We were impressed by your academic dedication and consistent performance."

You read it three times. Then you call your parents.
](else-if: $currentGPA >= 3.0)[
You have been accepted to your second choice university.

It is not the school you first dreamed of. But it is a great school, and you got here honestly.
](else-if: $currentGPA >= 2.5)[
You have been accepted to a college — your third choice.

It is not what you imagined. But a door is open.
](else-if: $currentGPA <= 2.4)[
This year, you were not accepted to university.

It stings. But it is not the end. There are paths forward.
]

Your final GPA: (print: $currentGPA)

[[Read the closing message->Ending]]


:: September {"position":"525,25","size":"100,100"}
(display: "StatDisplay")
# September — A Fresh Start
<img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1503676260728-1c00da094a0b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Sunlight hitting a classroom desk">

The halls smell like new sneakers and anxiety. It is the first week of Grade 12 and everything feels manageable.

Your English teacher Mr. Hargrove holds up his hand before anyone can speak.

"This year, I want you to do your own thinking. There are tools out there that will try to do it for you. Do not let them. Your mind is the only thing that is truly yours."

(set: $energy to (min: 100, $energy + 5))

[[Continue->Late September]]


